@startuml
 title Краевой сценарий — полный буфер
 hide footbox
 autonumber
 participant "Календарь событий" as Calendar
 control "Ядро модели" as Engine
 participant "Источник ИБ / ИЗ2" as Source
 control "Диспетчер постановки ДП" as Admission
 participant "Политика переполнения" as Overflow
 queue "Очередь маршрутизации\nД1ОЗ2" as Buffer
 participant "Последняя ожидающая заявка" as LastOrder
 participant "Новая заявка" as Incoming
 participant "Статистика" as Stats
 control "Диспетчер выбора ДВ" as Scheduler
 control "Пул центров / указатель Д2П2" as Pool
 participant "Распределительный центр" as Center

 note over Buffer, Pool
 Предусловие: буфер заполнен; все центры заняты.
 end note
 Calendar -> Engine: OrderGenerated(sourceId, t)
 Engine -> Source: createOrder(t)
 Source --> Engine: Incoming
 Engine -> Source: sampleInterArrival() [ИЗ2]
 Source --> Engine: Δt ~ U(Tmin, Tmax)
 Engine -> Calendar: scheduleArrival(sourceId, t + Δt)
 Engine -> Stats: recordGenerated(Incoming)
 Engine -> Admission: onOrderGenerated(Incoming)
 Admission -> Buffer: isFull()?
 Buffer --> Admission: true
 Admission -> Overflow: handleFull(buffer, Incoming)
 Overflow -> Buffer: removeNewestWaiting()
 Buffer --> Overflow: LastOrder
 Overflow -> Buffer: enqueueTail(Incoming) [Д1ОЗ2]
 Buffer --> Overflow: stored
 Overflow --> Admission: accepted + evicted LastOrder
 Admission --> Engine: AdmissionResult(accepted=true, evictedOrder=LastOrder)
 Engine -> Stats: recordEviction(LastOrder)
 Engine -> Scheduler: onOrderAccepted(Incoming.id, t)
 Scheduler -> Pool: findNextFreeFromPointer() [Д2П2]
 Pool --> Scheduler: NONE — все центры заняты
 Scheduler -> Scheduler: Не извлекать заявку; сохранить очередь и ожидать
 ... модельное время до завершения одного обслуживания ...
 Calendar -> Engine: ServiceCompleted(centerId, orderId, tEnd)
 Engine -> Center: finishService(tEnd)
 Center --> Engine: completedOrder + device released
 Engine -> Stats: recordServiceCompleted(completedOrder)
 Engine -> Scheduler: onDeviceReleased(centerId, tEnd)
 Scheduler -> Pool: findNextFreeFromPointer() [Д2П2]
 Pool --> Scheduler: свободный центр
 Scheduler -> Buffer: getWaitingOrders()
 Buffer --> Scheduler: очередь, включая Incoming (если он выбран по приоритету)
 Scheduler -> Scheduler: выбрать одну заявку по приоритету источника [Д2Б4]
 Scheduler -> Buffer: remove(selectedOrder)
 Buffer --> Scheduler: selectedOrder
 Scheduler -> Pool: markAssigned(freeCenter)
 Pool -> Center: startService(selectedOrder, tEnd)
 Pool -> Pool: pointer = позиция после выбранного центра
 Center --> Pool: ServiceStarted
 Pool --> Scheduler: AssignmentConfirmed
 Scheduler -> Stats: recordServiceStarted(selectedOrder, freeCenter, tEnd)
 Scheduler -> Calendar: schedule ServiceCompleted по ПЗ1
@enduml
